      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T16:18:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for all those inputs. Basically both options should work for this, and there is no that much difference between them, pros or cons. \nSince we\u0027re aligned here, I\u0027m +2 to Zhenchao\u0027s original CL, and let\u0027s move forward with that.",
      "parentUuid": "5dec4448_0c9426de",
      "revId": "5bc1377b9efeddb8469000f915a05aa3fd417eff",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
